t this summer try my  veggie bun sliders  veggie buns lower the calories and  carbohydrates and increase the vitamins  minerals and fiber i started with the  primal kitchen condiments including the  unsweetened ketchup  award-winning buffalo sauce and famous  avocado oil mayo besides loading up on  veggies at your grill out  focus on using condiments that are made  with high quality ingredients and free  of added sugar or artificial ingredients  like these by primal kitchen made with  avocado oil and savory spices find them  on amazon and most major grocery stores  my last summer essentials will help you  stay calm and relaxed  all season long keep zao ashwagandha on  hand which is an ancient indian herb  that may help the body manage stress or  make your own calming spa wellness water  with  cherry-flavored zao kom now formulated  with ashwagandha and other herbs with  potential calming effects like lemon  balm and hawthorne berry find both at  walmart  and soundnutrition.com research also  suggests that certain foods may help  promote feelings of calm like nuts seeds  and whole grains rich in magnesium and  mackerel and pasture-raised eggs sources  of omega-3 fats  i hope you enjoyed these recipes and  tips you can find them at my website  nutritionbymia.com  and nutritionbymia on instagram where i  also share meal ideas  and nutrition tips daily
 

